<title>MOROCCO: Morocco tenders for fishing monitoring system.</title>
<headline>Morocco tenders for fishing monitoring system.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco's Fisheries ministry on Wednesday launched two international tenders to install a satellite monitoring system for fishing vessels and to purchase four rescue boats.</p>
<p>The ministry sets February 28 as closing date for the would-be bidders.</p>
</text>
